{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02667",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 7.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "all set here, doctor. Chart's updated, and I'll read the readings out when you're ready"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.58,
      "end_seconds": 12.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.92,
      "end_seconds": 30.04,
      "duration_seconds": 16.12,
      "text": "Honestly, it's poor concentration, and my family pushed me to come. My neighbour said I should get it looked at. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 33.79,
      "end_seconds": 43.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pulse 73, temp 36.5 degrees, BP is 123 over 71, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.48,
      "end_seconds": 49.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Okay, noted. How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.35,
      "end_seconds": 53.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Ah, for three weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.69,
      "end_seconds": 58.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.13,
      "end_seconds": 60.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.06,
      "end_seconds": 65.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "let me check a few things any rash or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.15,
      "end_seconds": 73.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "no, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.45,
      "end_seconds": 77.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Any fever or joint swelling at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.0,
      "end_seconds": 87.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "No fever or joint swelling, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.01,
      "end_seconds": 91.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.06,
      "end_seconds": 94.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.15,
      "end_seconds": 97.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "how's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.72,
      "end_seconds": 101.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.76,
      "end_seconds": 119.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "So, do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.24,
      "end_seconds": 125.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.74,
      "end_seconds": 128.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.04,
      "end_seconds": 134.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.06,
      "end_seconds": 138.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.75,
      "end_seconds": 143.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.83,
      "end_seconds": 160.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.76,
      "end_seconds": 166.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "I've had gout for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.24,
      "end_seconds": 172.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Okay, I can see gout in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.01,
      "end_seconds": 192.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.03,
      "end_seconds": 197.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Yes, naproxen. I get stomach pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.37,
      "end_seconds": 204.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.63,
      "end_seconds": 207.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.78,
      "end_seconds": 212.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.01,
      "end_seconds": 218.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Febuxostat. I take it 80 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.34,
      "end_seconds": 221.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.38,
      "end_seconds": 226.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.82,
      "end_seconds": 242.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Your joints are not swollen and you are tender over many muscle points."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.23,
      "end_seconds": 246.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.39,
      "end_seconds": 269.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "having listened and examined, I can't pin this down yet we're looking at fibromyalgia or polymyalgia"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.14,
      "end_seconds": 274.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Well, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.72,
      "end_seconds": 295.69,
      "duration_seconds": 19.97,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now fibromyalgia is my leading thought, not anything worse. I think blood tests makes sense here, for widespread pain. What I'm giving you is amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. That should help with pain and sleep."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.46,
      "end_seconds": 299.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "that's simple enough"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.21,
      "end_seconds": 307.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "Gentle graded exercise such as swimming helps more than rest. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.16,
      "end_seconds": 311.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.55,
      "end_seconds": 313.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}